  "body": "Tender: Closes on Thursday 5 November 2026 at 11:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nNestled in a highly desirable pocket of Bucklands Beach, this property enjoys a peaceful setting on Clovelly Road, surrounded by quality homes in an established and sought-after neighbourhood. \r\n\r\nSet on a generous 885sqm site, it presents a wonderful opportunity to secure a property in one of East Auckland’s most appealing coastal communities. With its quiet surroundings, desirable address and excellent school zoning, this location offers both lifestyle appeal and lasting desirability.\r\n\r\nThe home features 2 bedrooms, 1 bathroom, a garage and two basement areas providing additional storage space. Neat and tidy, it offers comfortable living with scope to personalise to your own taste.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a fantastic coastal lifestyle with nearby beaches within walking distance and Howick Golf Club close by. The property is zoned for Bucklands Beach Primary, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College — a highly sought-after combination for families.\r\n\r\nA peaceful neighbourhood, sought-after school zones and a premium coastal location — an opportunity not to be missed!\r\n\r\nContact us today for more information or visit our open home.",
